https://pacxon4u.com,games,en,"PACXON - play the game Pac-xon, FREE!","In the game Pacxon, you are on a mission to eat as much of each stage as you can before the dreaded ghosts eat you! Once you have consumed and digested a full 80% of the stage, the stage is considered completed and you can move on. In the beginning, the stages are pretty simple. A couple of ghosts here or there. Nothing to worry about. The later stages though will be crawling with ghosts. Small ghosts, big ghosts, fast ghosts... you name it. They will come at you in big numbers too making it difficult to avoid them. Overall, I'd give Pacxon a solid 'A' as the game is very fun to play and quite addicting as well. The game has many similarities with Pacman so if you liked Pacman or Ms Pacman, then you'll probably like Pacxon too.",432,25,8,0,1,13,0,0,0,1,1,0
https://pacxon.org,games,en,"Pacxon, Pacxon HTML5 Game, Play Pac-Xon","In Pac-Xon, You must fill empty space and capture ghosts by building walls. As soon as you fill 80% or more empty spaces, you will go to the next level. Beware of ghosts! If one touches you or the wall you're building, you lose a life! Unlike in the Pacman or Ms Pacman games, the amount and difficulty of the ghosts will change as you advance in levels. There are your common, run-of-the-mill ghosts that can be walled off. Then there are special wraith like ghosts that can float right through walls! There is also a gigantic ghost that is slow to move but will eat the walls you've built so be careful because he'll be tough to wall off. That said, this fun spin off of Pac Man has turned into a fan favorite for many. To play Pacxon, you must eat 80% of each level while avoiding the ghosts. Different ghosts can hurt you in different ways so be careful and the number of ghosts will increase to the point where the screen is literally crawling with them..",199,13,3,0,1,16,0,0,0,1,1,0
https://pacxon.us,games,en,PACXON - Play the game online FREE!,"Carefully block off the ghosts by eating the columns and rows of the grid. Once you eat 80% of the grid, you win! If a ghost hits you or even if the ghost hits the column or row that you're eating, you'll lose a life. As a general strategy, don't bite off more than you can chew... literally. Only eat small sections of the grid at a time to keep Pacxon alive and well. If you get too risky and start eating huge chunks, you could wind up losing a life. Although, I do have to admit that it's exciting to see how big a chunk you can eat at a time.",136,15,4,0,1,15,0,0,0,1,1,0
